# Runtime attachments storage (under data/uploads/) — already covered by `data/`
# below. The earlier blanket `attachments/` rule mistakenly hid the
# `core/attachments/` source module, so we don't use it.

# Database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/
db_data/

# Per-agent persistent memories — local to each user's setup. The
# core/memory/ Python module is tracked, but the data it writes into
# agent-memory/ contains the user's personal memories (preferences,
# notes from conversations, etc.) and must not be committed.
agent-memory/

